# Palantír of Orthanc: at the beginning of its controller's end step it gets an influence counter, they scry 2, and the
# target opponent may have them draw a card. Bot2 declines, so Bot1 mills one card (one counter): Lightning Bolt, mana
# value 1, and Bot2 loses 1 life.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Sol Ring
Mox Pearl
Palantír of Orthanc
Island x3
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x15

[Actions]
